cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or this code, please cite both the preprint (preferred-citation) and this repository."
type: software
title: "Code and data for: Developmental and Phylogenetic Patterns of Antennal Expansion in Leaf-Footed Bugs (Hemiptera: Coreidae)"
abstract: "Data and R code for the comparative study of antennal expansion in leaf-footed bugs (Hemiptera: Coreidae). Contains the antennomere-by-antennomere scoring of antennal morphology for adults (species level) and nymphs (genus level), built from research-grade iNaturalist photographs and primary taxonomic descriptions, together with the phylogeny used, the stored Mk and hidden-rates model fits, and the R script that reproduces every ancestral-state reconstruction and figure."
